SUMMARY:Pumpkin Carving Contest\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20260918T170000
UID:e864bec443ad31a4a38a7977151898a8@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:McCormick&rsquo\;s Creek is asking local businesses\, organiza
 tions\, and artists to donate a Jack-o-Lantern for our Falloween Event thi
 s year. Jack-o-Lanterns will be on display for guests to see and vote on t
 heir favorite! Win a 2027 Annual Entrance Pass to Indiana State Parks! &nb
 sp\; Pumpkins Must be Dropped off on October 23rd at Nature Center &nbsp\;
 ENTER IF YOU DARE! Register by Emailing: Jfiler@dnr.IN.gov Registration du
 e Friday\, October 16\, 2026 &nbsp\; Please send a logo for your business/
 organization when registering. Your business/organization logo will be on 
 display next to your pumpkin. Please label the bottom of your pumpkin in p
 ermanent marker. Your Jack-o-Lantern will be on display during our Pumpkin
  Parade event on October 24th from 5:30 pm-7:30 pm. Where guests will vote
  for their favorite Jack-o-Lantern. All Jack-O-Lanterns will be shown on o
 ur Facebook page.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, 250 McCormick's Creek Park Road\, 
 Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.in.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
