UID:6f8a07c9d8c7b0d9a815141d87c34168@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Nature Game &amp\; Craft) Did you know that many nocturnal in
 sects rely on scent instead of sight? Come into the Nature Center to learn
  about insect communication in this fun activity. Create a moth puppet to 
 take home.
