BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Night Hike to Wolf Cave\, McCormick's Creek State Park
DTSTART;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Indiana/Indianapolis:20261002T210000
UID:0c621427acf89bc419153054a4f1263b@events.in.gov
DESCRIPTION:(Hike) Meet Naturalist Kaitlyn at Pine Bluff Shelter for a rug
 ged night hike to Wolf Cave. On this hike\, you will take the newly open s
 ide of Trail 5 to explore wildlife at night\, with a chance to go through 
 Wolf Cave. This hike is 2 miles and requires wearing closed-toed shoes. Br
 ing a redlight flashlight or head lamp or borrow one from the naturalist.
LOCATION:McCormick's Creek State Park\, Nature Center\, 250 McCormick's Cr
 eek Park Road\, Spencer\, IN 47460
URL:on.IN.gov/mccormickscreek
X-SOURCE:McCormick's Creek State Park
END:VEVENT
